--- PROVENANCE OF THIS FILE, STATED BECAUSE v4203 LEARNED WHY IT MATTERS -------------

The text below is the STANDARD MIT (Expat) permission notice, reproduced under the
copyright holder named above. It was NOT fetched from the upstream repository and is
not claimed to be a byte-for-byte copy of upstream's own LICENSE file -- this sandbox
does not reach the network.

That distinction is the point of writing it down. At v4203 three of this tree's own
licence records turned out to be wrong in the file whose entire purpose was quoting
licences verbatim, including one truncated to 48 words of 77 that dropped an
attribution requirement. A licence reproduced from memory and LABELLED as such is
honest; the same text labelled "verbatim from upstream" would be the v4203 mistake
committed again. Anyone with network access should replace this block with upstream's
own LICENSE and delete this paragraph.

